Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

The rebuilt proof reaches `#Top`, but its semantics treats Python string length as UTF-8 byte length. Consequently, `["😀"]` returns `["😀"]` in K but `[]` in both Python implementations—a material unrestricted-domain failure.

Detailed report: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Commands and evidence: [evidence](/audit-output/evidence)
diff --git a/REVIEW.md b/REVIEW.md
